[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.210",
    "end": "00:00:01.650",
    "start_seconds": 0.21,
    "end_seconds": 1.65,
    "text": "- You're going to learn three ways"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:01.650",
    "end": "00:00:04.170",
    "start_seconds": 1.65,
    "end_seconds": 4.17,
    "text": "to be seen as the leader in the room"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.170",
    "end": "00:00:06.000",
    "start_seconds": 4.17,
    "end_seconds": 6.0,
    "text": "and we're gonna reverse engineer this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.000",
    "end": "00:00:08.640",
    "start_seconds": 6.0,
    "end_seconds": 8.64,
    "text": "As we look at these top three skill sets you'll notice"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.640",
    "end": "00:00:10.620",
    "start_seconds": 8.64,
    "end_seconds": 10.62,
    "text": "if you think about the best leaders you know,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.620",
    "end": "00:00:12.060",
    "start_seconds": 10.62,
    "end_seconds": 12.06,
    "text": "this is how they show up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.060",
    "end": "00:00:13.770",
    "start_seconds": 12.06,
    "end_seconds": 13.77,
    "text": "And once you know what they're doing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.770",
    "end": "00:00:15.900",
    "start_seconds": 13.77,
    "end_seconds": 15.9,
    "text": "you can improve those same skills."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.900",
    "end": "00:00:18.030",
    "start_seconds": 15.9,
    "end_seconds": 18.03,
    "text": "So let's assume you're not the official leader"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.030",
    "end": "00:00:19.350",
    "start_seconds": 18.03,
    "end_seconds": 19.35,
    "text": "in the room every time yet."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.350",
    "end": "00:00:21.540",
    "start_seconds": 19.35,
    "end_seconds": 21.54,
    "text": "How can you establish yourself"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.540",
    "end": "00:00:24.240",
    "start_seconds": 21.54,
    "end_seconds": 24.24,
    "text": "as an obvious emerging leader in that group?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.240",
    "end": "00:00:27.420",
    "start_seconds": 24.24,
    "end_seconds": 27.42,
    "text": "And I have just one caveat, before I give you the top three,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.420",
    "end": "00:00:30.330",
    "start_seconds": 27.42,
    "end_seconds": 30.33,
    "text": "I'm assuming that you're already good and competent"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.330",
    "end": "00:00:33.420",
    "start_seconds": 30.33,
    "end_seconds": 33.42,
    "text": "at your actual individual job responsibilities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.420",
    "end": "00:00:36.630",
    "start_seconds": 33.42,
    "end_seconds": 36.63,
    "text": "In no way should we ever view communication skills"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.630",
    "end": "00:00:40.230",
    "start_seconds": 36.63,
    "end_seconds": 40.23,
    "text": "as a way to hide your shortcomings or incompetence,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.230",
    "end": "00:00:43.800",
    "start_seconds": 40.23,
    "end_seconds": 43.8,
    "text": "your knowledge, skills and expertise are prerequisites."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.800",
    "end": "00:00:45.480",
    "start_seconds": 43.8,
    "end_seconds": 45.48,
    "text": "And if these sound like the kind of skills"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.480",
    "end": "00:00:47.790",
    "start_seconds": 45.48,
    "end_seconds": 47.79,
    "text": "you want to get better at, I encourage you to take a look"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.790",
    "end": "00:00:49.890",
    "start_seconds": 47.79,
    "end_seconds": 49.89,
    "text": "at my Communication Coach Academy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.890",
    "end": "00:00:53.190",
    "start_seconds": 49.89,
    "end_seconds": 53.19,
    "text": "We offer classes and group coaching on communication skills,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.190",
    "end": "00:00:54.840",
    "start_seconds": 53.19,
    "end_seconds": 54.84,
    "text": "public speaking and leadership."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.840",
    "end": "00:00:57.180",
    "start_seconds": 54.84,
    "end_seconds": 57.18,
    "text": "There's a link in the description below this video."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.180",
    "end": "00:00:58.710",
    "start_seconds": 57.18,
    "end_seconds": 58.71,
    "text": "Now let's talk about three ways"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.710",
    "end": "00:01:00.540",
    "start_seconds": 58.71,
    "end_seconds": 60.54,
    "text": "to come across like a leader."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.540",
    "end": "00:01:02.250",
    "start_seconds": 60.54,
    "end_seconds": 62.25,
    "text": "And if you think of some additional ways"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.250",
    "end": "00:01:03.120",
    "start_seconds": 62.25,
    "end_seconds": 63.12,
    "text": "to be seen as a leader,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.120",
    "end": "00:01:05.490",
    "start_seconds": 63.12,
    "end_seconds": 65.49,
    "text": "then please leave that in the comments"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.490",
    "end": "00:01:07.680",
    "start_seconds": 65.49,
    "end_seconds": 67.68,
    "text": "and we look forward to reading your tips."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.680",
    "end": "00:01:10.320",
    "start_seconds": 67.68,
    "end_seconds": 70.32,
    "text": "First, leaders solve problems."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.320",
    "end": "00:01:12.450",
    "start_seconds": 70.32,
    "end_seconds": 72.45,
    "text": "When the best leaders see a need,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.450",
    "end": "00:01:14.640",
    "start_seconds": 72.45,
    "end_seconds": 74.64,
    "text": "they take initiative, they take action."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.640",
    "end": "00:01:17.310",
    "start_seconds": 74.64,
    "end_seconds": 77.31,
    "text": "In contrast, many non-leader see a problem"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.310",
    "end": "00:01:19.950",
    "start_seconds": 77.31,
    "end_seconds": 79.95,
    "text": "and they're great about talking about the problem,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.950",
    "end": "00:01:22.140",
    "start_seconds": 79.95,
    "end_seconds": 82.14,
    "text": "maybe complaining, pointing the fingers"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.140",
    "end": "00:01:25.080",
    "start_seconds": 82.14,
    "end_seconds": 85.08,
    "text": "and expecting other people to solve the problem."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.080",
    "end": "00:01:25.980",
    "start_seconds": 85.08,
    "end_seconds": 85.98,
    "text": "But the leader in the room"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.980",
    "end": "00:01:28.380",
    "start_seconds": 85.98,
    "end_seconds": 88.38,
    "text": "is the one who recommends possible solutions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.380",
    "end": "00:01:30.480",
    "start_seconds": 88.38,
    "end_seconds": 90.48,
    "text": "and offers to take action."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.480",
    "end": "00:01:34.350",
    "start_seconds": 90.48,
    "end_seconds": 94.35,
    "text": "And problem solvers have a specific and learnable skillset."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.350",
    "end": "00:01:36.480",
    "start_seconds": 94.35,
    "end_seconds": 96.47999999999999,
    "text": "You have to be able to look at a problem,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.480",
    "end": "00:01:38.970",
    "start_seconds": 96.47999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 98.97,
    "text": "diagnose the possible causes of that problem"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:38.970",
    "end": "00:01:40.710",
    "start_seconds": 98.97,
    "end_seconds": 100.71000000000001,
    "text": "and recommend a solution."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.710",
    "end": "00:01:43.530",
    "start_seconds": 100.71000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 103.53,
    "text": "As part of that, leaders must be able to make decisions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.530",
    "end": "00:01:46.050",
    "start_seconds": 103.53,
    "end_seconds": 106.05,
    "text": "That doesn't mean you need to make decisions instantly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.050",
    "end": "00:01:47.130",
    "start_seconds": 106.05,
    "end_seconds": 107.13,
    "text": "or without thought,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.130",
    "end": "00:01:49.710",
    "start_seconds": 107.13,
    "end_seconds": 109.71000000000001,
    "text": "but I will say this, a pattern of indecisiveness"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.710",
    "end": "00:01:51.960",
    "start_seconds": 109.71000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 111.96000000000001,
    "text": "won't demonstrate your leadership."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.960",
    "end": "00:01:53.880",
    "start_seconds": 111.96000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 113.88,
    "text": "So here's a tip within a tip,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.880",
    "end": "00:01:55.740",
    "start_seconds": 113.88,
    "end_seconds": 115.74000000000001,
    "text": "when you suggest solutions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.740",
    "end": "00:01:57.630",
    "start_seconds": 115.74000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 117.63,
    "text": "be ready to break those solutions down"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.630",
    "end": "00:01:59.730",
    "start_seconds": 117.63,
    "end_seconds": 119.72999999999999,
    "text": "into a few action steps."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.730",
    "end": "00:02:02.400",
    "start_seconds": 119.72999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 122.4,
    "text": "A leader might say, for example, \"These are three steps"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:02.400",
    "end": "00:02:03.960",
    "start_seconds": 122.4,
    "end_seconds": 123.96,
    "text": "to solving this problem.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.960",
    "end": "00:02:06.870",
    "start_seconds": 123.96,
    "end_seconds": 126.87,
    "text": "And then you would concisely spell out those three steps,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.870",
    "end": "00:02:09.120",
    "start_seconds": 126.87,
    "end_seconds": 129.12,
    "text": "that demonstrates that you thought carefully"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.120",
    "end": "00:02:10.470",
    "start_seconds": 129.12,
    "end_seconds": 130.47,
    "text": "about the solution."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.470",
    "end": "00:02:13.590",
    "start_seconds": 130.47,
    "end_seconds": 133.59,
    "text": "And by providing a solution and a course of action,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.590",
    "end": "00:02:16.710",
    "start_seconds": 133.59,
    "end_seconds": 136.71,
    "text": "other people will literally be following your plan"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.710",
    "end": "00:02:17.730",
    "start_seconds": 136.71,
    "end_seconds": 137.73,
    "text": "and that comes across"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.730",
    "end": "00:02:21.390",
    "start_seconds": 137.73,
    "end_seconds": 141.39,
    "text": "as an obvious problem solving leadership moment for you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.390",
    "end": "00:02:22.470",
    "start_seconds": 141.39,
    "end_seconds": 142.47,
    "text": "Other people notice that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.470",
    "end": "00:02:24.810",
    "start_seconds": 142.47,
    "end_seconds": 144.81,
    "text": "So tip one, you'll come across like a leader"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.810",
    "end": "00:02:26.850",
    "start_seconds": 144.81,
    "end_seconds": 146.85,
    "text": "if you solve problems."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.850",
    "end": "00:02:29.340",
    "start_seconds": 146.85,
    "end_seconds": 149.34,
    "text": "Second, leaders are good with groups."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.340",
    "end": "00:02:32.130",
    "start_seconds": 149.34,
    "end_seconds": 152.13,
    "text": "The best leaders make contributions to group discussions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.130",
    "end": "00:02:33.480",
    "start_seconds": 152.13,
    "end_seconds": 153.48,
    "text": "in three ways,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.480",
    "end": "00:02:34.890",
    "start_seconds": 153.48,
    "end_seconds": 154.89,
    "text": "effective leaders make contributions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.890",
    "end": "00:02:37.320",
    "start_seconds": 154.89,
    "end_seconds": 157.32,
    "text": "on the task related work at meetings."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.320",
    "end": "00:02:40.230",
    "start_seconds": 157.32,
    "end_seconds": 160.23,
    "text": "So everything you say should add value and be helpful"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.230",
    "end": "00:02:41.340",
    "start_seconds": 160.23,
    "end_seconds": 161.34,
    "text": "in one way or another."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:41.340",
    "end": "00:02:43.620",
    "start_seconds": 161.34,
    "end_seconds": 163.62,
    "text": "Specifically, most leaders stay on topic"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.620",
    "end": "00:02:45.090",
    "start_seconds": 163.62,
    "end_seconds": 165.09,
    "text": "and don't go on tangents."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.090",
    "end": "00:02:46.710",
    "start_seconds": 165.09,
    "end_seconds": 166.71,
    "text": "Leaders offer their point of view"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.710",
    "end": "00:02:49.890",
    "start_seconds": 166.71,
    "end_seconds": 169.89,
    "text": "or provide helpful information on the task at hand"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.890",
    "end": "00:02:51.750",
    "start_seconds": 169.89,
    "end_seconds": 171.75,
    "text": "and if a conversation gets off track,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.750",
    "end": "00:02:55.020",
    "start_seconds": 171.75,
    "end_seconds": 175.02,
    "text": "it's the leader's job to get the conversation back on track."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.020",
    "end": "00:02:58.290",
    "start_seconds": 175.02,
    "end_seconds": 178.29,
    "text": "Now on this topic, I want to offer a word of caution."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.290",
    "end": "00:03:00.090",
    "start_seconds": 178.29,
    "end_seconds": 180.09,
    "text": "Some people mistakenly believe"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.090",
    "end": "00:03:02.400",
    "start_seconds": 180.09,
    "end_seconds": 182.4,
    "text": "that the leader is the person who should talk the most"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.400",
    "end": "00:03:03.750",
    "start_seconds": 182.4,
    "end_seconds": 183.75,
    "text": "at most meetings."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.750",
    "end": "00:03:06.210",
    "start_seconds": 183.75,
    "end_seconds": 186.21,
    "text": "that could be the case in some situations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.210",
    "end": "00:03:08.670",
    "start_seconds": 186.21,
    "end_seconds": 188.67,
    "text": "if you're already the official leader in the room."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.670",
    "end": "00:03:11.400",
    "start_seconds": 188.67,
    "end_seconds": 191.4,
    "text": "However, if there's already an official leader there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.400",
    "end": "00:03:13.440",
    "start_seconds": 191.4,
    "end_seconds": 193.44,
    "text": "you should not talk more than they do"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.440",
    "end": "00:03:15.720",
    "start_seconds": 193.44,
    "end_seconds": 195.72,
    "text": "and you shouldn't even be the second place talker,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.720",
    "end": "00:03:16.553",
    "start_seconds": 195.72,
    "end_seconds": 196.553,
    "text": "we'll call it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.553",
    "end": "00:03:18.750",
    "start_seconds": 196.553,
    "end_seconds": 198.75,
    "text": "If you were in a class in college or high school,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.750",
    "end": "00:03:21.210",
    "start_seconds": 198.75,
    "end_seconds": 201.21,
    "text": "then you might remember how people respond"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.210",
    "end": "00:03:23.730",
    "start_seconds": 201.21,
    "end_seconds": 203.73,
    "text": "when one person talks more than anyone else,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.730",
    "end": "00:03:25.410",
    "start_seconds": 203.73,
    "end_seconds": 205.41,
    "text": "it doesn't create a great vibe"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.410",
    "end": "00:03:28.380",
    "start_seconds": 205.41,
    "end_seconds": 208.38,
    "text": "for the other students or for the teacher"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.380",
    "end": "00:03:30.930",
    "start_seconds": 208.38,
    "end_seconds": 210.93,
    "text": "and you obviously don't want to be the quietest"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.930",
    "end": "00:03:33.390",
    "start_seconds": 210.93,
    "end_seconds": 213.39,
    "text": "or most reserved person in the group."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.390",
    "end": "00:03:35.760",
    "start_seconds": 213.39,
    "end_seconds": 215.76,
    "text": "When it comes to task related conversations,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.760",
    "end": "00:03:37.590",
    "start_seconds": 215.76,
    "end_seconds": 217.59,
    "text": "you want to be right in the middle"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.590",
    "end": "00:03:39.810",
    "start_seconds": 217.59,
    "end_seconds": 219.81,
    "text": "and contribute about an average amount."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.810",
    "end": "00:03:41.850",
    "start_seconds": 219.81,
    "end_seconds": 221.85,
    "text": "Another way leaders demonstrate their effectiveness"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.850",
    "end": "00:03:43.440",
    "start_seconds": 221.85,
    "end_seconds": 223.44,
    "text": "in groups is by excelling"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.440",
    "end": "00:03:46.290",
    "start_seconds": 223.44,
    "end_seconds": 226.29,
    "text": "at relationship oriented communication."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.290",
    "end": "00:03:48.990",
    "start_seconds": 226.29,
    "end_seconds": 228.99,
    "text": "Effective leaders take the time to connect socially"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.990",
    "end": "00:03:51.180",
    "start_seconds": 228.99,
    "end_seconds": 231.18,
    "text": "with politeness and small talk"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.180",
    "end": "00:03:53.340",
    "start_seconds": 231.18,
    "end_seconds": 233.34,
    "text": "before the meeting officially kicks off."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.340",
    "end": "00:03:56.010",
    "start_seconds": 233.34,
    "end_seconds": 236.01,
    "text": "They don't isolate themselves in the presence of the group,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.010",
    "end": "00:03:58.110",
    "start_seconds": 236.01,
    "end_seconds": 238.11,
    "text": "in other words, and during the meeting itself,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.110",
    "end": "00:04:01.830",
    "start_seconds": 238.11,
    "end_seconds": 241.83,
    "text": "they invest in relationships by encouraging other people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.830",
    "end": "00:04:05.310",
    "start_seconds": 241.83,
    "end_seconds": 245.31,
    "text": "Now, another word of caution on this, don't overdo it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.310",
    "end": "00:04:07.380",
    "start_seconds": 245.31,
    "end_seconds": 247.38,
    "text": "You don't want to focus so much on"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.380",
    "end": "00:04:10.890",
    "start_seconds": 247.38,
    "end_seconds": 250.89,
    "text": "how everybody's doing that it becomes a preoccupation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.890",
    "end": "00:04:12.997",
    "start_seconds": 250.89,
    "end_seconds": 252.997,
    "text": "like, \"Is everybody doing okay?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.997",
    "end": "00:04:14.077",
    "start_seconds": 252.997,
    "end_seconds": 254.077,
    "text": "\"Does anyone need anything?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.077",
    "end": "00:04:16.920",
    "start_seconds": 254.077,
    "end_seconds": 256.92,
    "text": "\"Is everybody comfortable and feeling attended to?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.920",
    "end": "00:04:19.410",
    "start_seconds": 256.92,
    "end_seconds": 259.41,
    "text": "If you make taking care of other people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.410",
    "end": "00:04:21.930",
    "start_seconds": 259.41,
    "end_seconds": 261.93,
    "text": "in the group your main focus,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.930",
    "end": "00:04:24.540",
    "start_seconds": 261.93,
    "end_seconds": 264.54,
    "text": "you may be unintentionally positioning yourself"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.540",
    "end": "00:04:28.890",
    "start_seconds": 264.54,
    "end_seconds": 268.89,
    "text": "as a merely supportive person in the meeting, not a leader."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.890",
    "end": "00:04:29.723",
    "start_seconds": 268.89,
    "end_seconds": 269.723,
    "text": "The cure for this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.723",
    "end": "00:04:32.460",
    "start_seconds": 269.723,
    "end_seconds": 272.46,
    "text": "is to make plenty of task related contributions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.460",
    "end": "00:04:34.650",
    "start_seconds": 272.46,
    "end_seconds": 274.65,
    "text": "and be generally considerate of others,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.650",
    "end": "00:04:37.650",
    "start_seconds": 274.65,
    "end_seconds": 277.65,
    "text": "but not preoccupied by other people's needs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:37.650",
    "end": "00:04:40.320",
    "start_seconds": 277.65,
    "end_seconds": 280.32,
    "text": "The next key way leaders are good with groups"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.320",
    "end": "00:04:43.860",
    "start_seconds": 280.32,
    "end_seconds": 283.86,
    "text": "is they develop a skill of facilitating the conversation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.860",
    "end": "00:04:45.720",
    "start_seconds": 283.86,
    "end_seconds": 285.72,
    "text": "Here are some ways that you can do this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.720",
    "end": "00:04:47.400",
    "start_seconds": 285.72,
    "end_seconds": 287.4,
    "text": "You can ask good questions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.400",
    "end": "00:04:49.260",
    "start_seconds": 287.4,
    "end_seconds": 289.26,
    "text": "if there are quiet members in the group,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.260",
    "end": "00:04:50.880",
    "start_seconds": 289.26,
    "end_seconds": 290.88,
    "text": "but you can tell they have something to say,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.880",
    "end": "00:04:53.370",
    "start_seconds": 290.88,
    "end_seconds": 293.37,
    "text": "help them get into the conversation a little bit."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.370",
    "end": "00:04:56.070",
    "start_seconds": 293.37,
    "end_seconds": 296.07,
    "text": "If the conversation is too long or drifting,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:56.070",
    "end": "00:04:57.930",
    "start_seconds": 296.07,
    "end_seconds": 297.93,
    "text": "you can refocus the discussion"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.930",
    "end": "00:05:01.710",
    "start_seconds": 297.93,
    "end_seconds": 301.71,
    "text": "by synthesizing the key themes or main points you've heard"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.710",
    "end": "00:05:03.870",
    "start_seconds": 301.71,
    "end_seconds": 303.87,
    "text": "and then reflect that back to the group."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.870",
    "end": "00:05:05.076",
    "start_seconds": 303.87,
    "end_seconds": 305.076,
    "text": "You could say,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.076",
    "end": "00:05:07.980",
    "start_seconds": 305.076,
    "end_seconds": 307.98,
    "text": "for example, \"It sounds like we have three main concerns.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.980",
    "end": "00:05:11.190",
    "start_seconds": 307.98,
    "end_seconds": 311.19,
    "text": "And then you would list those three concerns concisely."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.190",
    "end": "00:05:12.390",
    "start_seconds": 311.19,
    "end_seconds": 312.39,
    "text": "Listening carefully"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.390",
    "end": "00:05:14.480",
    "start_seconds": 312.39,
    "end_seconds": 314.48,
    "text": "and crystallizing the discussion like this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.480",
    "end": "00:05:17.970",
    "start_seconds": 314.48,
    "end_seconds": 317.97,
    "text": "is an incredibly valuable group facilitation skill."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.970",
    "end": "00:05:20.520",
    "start_seconds": 317.97,
    "end_seconds": 320.52,
    "text": "So number two, you look like a leader in the room"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.520",
    "end": "00:05:22.830",
    "start_seconds": 320.52,
    "end_seconds": 322.83,
    "text": "if you're good with groups."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.830",
    "end": "00:05:25.290",
    "start_seconds": 322.83,
    "end_seconds": 325.29,
    "text": "Third, leaders are effective communicators,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.290",
    "end": "00:05:27.300",
    "start_seconds": 325.29,
    "end_seconds": 327.3,
    "text": "or at least most leaders are."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.300",
    "end": "00:05:29.070",
    "start_seconds": 327.3,
    "end_seconds": 329.07,
    "text": "And when leaders are at their best,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.070",
    "end": "00:05:31.800",
    "start_seconds": 329.07,
    "end_seconds": 331.8,
    "text": "they're prepared, clear and concise"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.800",
    "end": "00:05:34.110",
    "start_seconds": 331.8,
    "end_seconds": 334.11,
    "text": "and if you do this, you'll come across like a leader."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.110",
    "end": "00:05:36.090",
    "start_seconds": 334.11,
    "end_seconds": 336.09000000000003,
    "text": "When you give a status update in front of the team,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:36.090",
    "end": "00:05:39.210",
    "start_seconds": 336.09000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 339.21,
    "text": "make sure you have your key points sketched out beforehand."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.210",
    "end": "00:05:41.490",
    "start_seconds": 339.21,
    "end_seconds": 341.49,
    "text": "Talk through your outline a few times before the meeting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:41.490",
    "end": "00:05:44.100",
    "start_seconds": 341.49,
    "end_seconds": 344.1,
    "text": "to make sure you're crisp and on point."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.100",
    "end": "00:05:46.950",
    "start_seconds": 344.1,
    "end_seconds": 346.95,
    "text": "Another way leaders demonstrate effective communication"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.950",
    "end": "00:05:49.230",
    "start_seconds": 346.95,
    "end_seconds": 349.23,
    "text": "is through the power of public speaking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:49.230",
    "end": "00:05:52.080",
    "start_seconds": 349.23,
    "end_seconds": 352.08,
    "text": "When you're doing a standup presentation for any reason,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.080",
    "end": "00:05:54.390",
    "start_seconds": 352.08,
    "end_seconds": 354.39,
    "text": "that's a leadership moment for you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.390",
    "end": "00:05:56.520",
    "start_seconds": 354.39,
    "end_seconds": 356.52,
    "text": "Make the most of it by preparing days"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.520",
    "end": "00:06:00.000",
    "start_seconds": 356.52,
    "end_seconds": 360.0,
    "text": "or even weeks in advance if it's an important presentation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:00.000",
    "end": "00:06:02.340",
    "start_seconds": 360.0,
    "end_seconds": 362.34,
    "text": "And let's not forget good listening."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.340",
    "end": "00:06:05.250",
    "start_seconds": 362.34,
    "end_seconds": 365.25,
    "text": "There's an expression that leaders are listeners."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:05.250",
    "end": "00:06:08.093",
    "start_seconds": 365.25,
    "end_seconds": 368.093,
    "text": "You can show that you're a good listener by paying attention"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.093",
    "end": "00:06:10.530",
    "start_seconds": 368.093,
    "end_seconds": 370.53,
    "text": "and taking notes when other people speak."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.530",
    "end": "00:06:12.720",
    "start_seconds": 370.53,
    "end_seconds": 372.72,
    "text": "I had a supervisor for years who took notes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.720",
    "end": "00:06:15.420",
    "start_seconds": 372.72,
    "end_seconds": 375.42,
    "text": "during every single one-on-one conversation we had."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:15.420",
    "end": "00:06:18.090",
    "start_seconds": 375.42,
    "end_seconds": 378.09,
    "text": "In contrast, if you were to communicate well,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:18.090",
    "end": "00:06:19.920",
    "start_seconds": 378.09,
    "end_seconds": 379.92,
    "text": "when it's your turn to talk"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.920",
    "end": "00:06:21.960",
    "start_seconds": 379.92,
    "end_seconds": 381.96,
    "text": "and then look at your device or tune out"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.960",
    "end": "00:06:23.250",
    "start_seconds": 381.96,
    "end_seconds": 383.25,
    "text": "when other people are speaking,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:23.250",
    "end": "00:06:25.320",
    "start_seconds": 383.25,
    "end_seconds": 385.32,
    "text": "you won't come across as a leader."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:25.320",
    "end": "00:06:27.240",
    "start_seconds": 385.32,
    "end_seconds": 387.24,
    "text": "You have to learn to listen carefully,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:27.240",
    "end": "00:06:30.210",
    "start_seconds": 387.24,
    "end_seconds": 390.21,
    "text": "even when the topic seems to have nothing to do"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.210",
    "end": "00:06:32.400",
    "start_seconds": 390.21,
    "end_seconds": 392.4,
    "text": "with your area of expertise."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:32.400",
    "end": "00:06:34.200",
    "start_seconds": 392.4,
    "end_seconds": 394.2,
    "text": "In summary, if you want to come across"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.200",
    "end": "00:06:35.520",
    "start_seconds": 394.2,
    "end_seconds": 395.52,
    "text": "as the leader in the room,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.520",
    "end": "00:06:38.040",
    "start_seconds": 395.52,
    "end_seconds": 398.04,
    "text": "start working on solving problems,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:38.040",
    "end": "00:06:39.900",
    "start_seconds": 398.04,
    "end_seconds": 399.9,
    "text": "get better at working in groups,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:39.900",
    "end": "00:06:42.930",
    "start_seconds": 399.9,
    "end_seconds": 402.93,
    "text": "and work on your communication skills at all levels."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.930",
    "end": "00:06:44.940",
    "start_seconds": 402.93,
    "end_seconds": 404.94,
    "text": "That's what the best leaders do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:44.940",
    "end": "00:06:47.040",
    "start_seconds": 404.94,
    "end_seconds": 407.04,
    "text": "Knowing that, you can reverse engineer it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:47.040",
    "end": "00:06:49.260",
    "start_seconds": 407.04,
    "end_seconds": 409.26,
    "text": "and help yourself come across like a leader,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.260",
    "end": "00:06:50.700",
    "start_seconds": 409.26,
    "end_seconds": 410.7,
    "text": "starting right away."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:50.700",
    "end": "00:06:52.110",
    "start_seconds": 410.7,
    "end_seconds": 412.11,
    "text": "And in that spirit, I wanted to tell you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:52.110",
    "end": "00:06:54.270",
    "start_seconds": 412.11,
    "end_seconds": 414.27,
    "text": "about my Communication Coach Academy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.270",
    "end": "00:06:56.130",
    "start_seconds": 414.27,
    "end_seconds": 416.13,
    "text": "There are free resources on the website"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.130",
    "end": "00:06:58.800",
    "start_seconds": 416.13,
    "end_seconds": 418.8,
    "text": "and we also offer classes, group coaching,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:58.800",
    "end": "00:07:00.600",
    "start_seconds": 418.8,
    "end_seconds": 420.6,
    "text": "and amazing communication templates"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.600",
    "end": "00:07:03.270",
    "start_seconds": 420.6,
    "end_seconds": 423.27,
    "text": "that will drastically speed up your progress,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.270",
    "end": "00:07:04.860",
    "start_seconds": 423.27,
    "end_seconds": 424.86,
    "text": "and lots of other resources."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.860",
    "end": "00:07:06.960",
    "start_seconds": 424.86,
    "end_seconds": 426.96,
    "text": "If you wanna take a look, there's a link to the academy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:06.960",
    "end": "00:07:08.610",
    "start_seconds": 426.96,
    "end_seconds": 428.61,
    "text": "in the description below the video"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:08.610",
    "end": "00:07:10.470",
    "start_seconds": 428.61,
    "end_seconds": 430.47,
    "text": "and it's also pinned in the first comment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:10.470",
    "end": "00:07:11.700",
    "start_seconds": 430.47,
    "end_seconds": 431.7,
    "text": "in the comment section."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.700",
    "end": "00:07:14.550",
    "start_seconds": 431.7,
    "end_seconds": 434.55,
    "text": "Speaking of which, I would love to hear any advice you have"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:14.550",
    "end": "00:07:17.310",
    "start_seconds": 434.55,
    "end_seconds": 437.31,
    "text": "about showing up as the leader in the room."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:17.310",
    "end": "00:07:19.470",
    "start_seconds": 437.31,
    "end_seconds": 439.47,
    "text": "Make your suggestion in the comment section below."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.470",
    "end": "00:07:22.460",
    "start_seconds": 439.47,
    "end_seconds": 442.46,
    "text": "Until next time, thanks, God bless, and I will see you soon."
  }
]
